      targets: [
      ],
      modifiers: [
      ],
      // [REVISAR] No pudo traducirse a modifier automaticamente.
      // [NO SOPORTADO] Mecánica/secuencia condicional: requiere modelado manual.
      descriptionTemplate: "The DMG Multipliers of the following skills are increased by 50%:  - Basic Attack - Huntress, Heavy Attack - Huntress, Tactical Dodge - Huntress, and Dodge Counter - Huntress - Basic Attack - Guts, Tactical Dodge - Guts, Dodge Counter - Guts. When A Girl Gets What She Wants! is triggered, Rebecca gains 3 additional  of Street Smarts for 12s. Upon performing Tactical Dodge - Huntress or Tactical Dodge - Guts, if Rebecca has sufficient Street Smarts stacks, 1  will be consumed to restore 20 STA. Resonance Liberation BOOM! Fireworks! is immune to interruption.",
    },
    {
      id: "Rebecca_s2",
      name: "S2: Oh, Hey Choom!",
