      // [NO SOPORTADO] Mecánica/secuencia condicional: requiere modelado manual.
      descriptionTemplate: "Rebecca's Resonance Liberation - Party 'til Dawn!, and Resonance Liberation - BOOM! Fireworks! gain 60% DMG Multiplier increase. Rebecca's Resonance Liberation - Party 'til Dawn! gains 30% more explosion range. Casting Intro Skill - Yo, It's Big Boomin' Time! or Intro Skill - Hey, Leadhead, Come 'n' Get Me! grants 120 points of Hot Hand.",
